WEBVTT

00:00:00.024 --> 00:00:04.402
A practical prompt is easier to debug when its parts are explicit.

00:00:04.402 --> 00:00:12.347
Separate the system role, the task, the context, the constraints, and the required output format.

00:00:12.347 --> 00:00:18.202
Clear structure makes it easier to identify what should change when the output is wrong.

00:00:18.202 --> 00:00:22.657
If the output is wrong, this structure tells you where to look.

00:00:22.657 --> 00:00:31.384
Was the task unclear, was the context incomplete, were the constraints missing, or was the output format underspecified?
